WEBVTT

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.120
In this show, I'm inviting myself
inside the minds

00:02:30.144 --> 00:02:32.196
of some truly unusual people,

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:35.515
because they've mastered something
I wish everyone knew about work.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:38.376
Today -- authenticity,

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:41.216
and why bringing your whole self to work

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:43.700
might be more complicated than you think.

00:02:45.690 --> 00:02:48.593
Thanks to Accenture
for sponsoring this episode.

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:00.901
For decades,